==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''40 Million Downloads'''}} for The Battle Cats! Another milestone on the Cat Army's march across the universe!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between January 14th (11:00am) and January 28th (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● 40 Million Downloads Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event period to take on {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival'''}} or {{Color|#FF0000|'''Celebration'''}} stages!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・40M Celebration Gifts Galore!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage and earn cool rewards like Rare or Normal tickets for your high score!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・"Deadly Carnival" 1, 2, & 3!'''}}<br>
The toughest test is here... can you stand the heat?<br>
Now including the all-new stage {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Deadly Carnival 3'''}}!<br>
See if YOU are up to the challenge of these Deadly-grade stages!<br>
Clear the first stage for a reward of 3 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear. Players who have previously cleared these stages will not be able to collect the rewards.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}

Take on this challenge each day and stockpile building materials!<br>
<small><small>※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (1/14, 1/16, 1/18, 1/20, 1/22, 1/24, 1/26, 1/28)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days (1/15, 1/17, 1/19, 1/21, 1/23, 1/25, 1/27)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''1/16, 1/19, 1/22, 1/25 and 1/28'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign!
Check in and profit!

